OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity failing fire-hit former
OL,4,Acampus, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents who live near a former
OL,7,Funiversity campus where a large fire
OL,8,Fburned have said they are "fed up",
OL,9,Fclaiming the building's security had
OL,10,F"lapsed", leaving it vulnerable.
OL,12,FFire crews were called to a blaze in
OL,13,Fthe roof of the unoccupied building at
OL,14,Fthe Liverpool John Moores University
OL,15,F(LJMU) IM Marsh site on Barkhill Road
OL,16,Fin Liverpool just after 15:40 BST on
OL,17,FSaturday.
OL,19,FDave Thomas, chair of Mossley Hill
OL,20,FResidents Association, said the
OL,21,Funiversity was "not looking after it
OL,22,Fproperly".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
