OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity failing fire-hit former
OL,4,Acampus, residents say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA LJMU representative said security had
OL,7,Fbeen stepped up after reports of
OL,8,Fanti-social behaviour in the summer,
OL,9,Fincluding dog patrols and CCTV, and
OL,10,Fadditional security measures would now
OL,11,Fbe put in place.
